Package: scalefusion
Type: Package
Title: Cross-Scale Semantic Visualization for Bioinformatics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iman", "Sadeghi", email = "i.sadeghi@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides coherent visualization across molecular, cellular, tissue, and patient scales, with explicit scale-disagreement diagnostics so users see which scale is changing the answer.
    Part of the bioviz suite of ten complementary visualization modules
    for advanced bioinformatics analysis and publication-grade figures.
